[4] There was a girl named Sophie who lived in a small village. She loved to play with her cat, Mr. Whiskers. One day, while they were playing together, Sophie noticed that Mr. Whiskers was chasing after a butterfly.

I couldn't help but think that Mr. Whiskers was very good at catching butterflies. I thought that maybe he could catch one if he ran really fast.

So Sophie ran really fast after him, shouting "Go catch him! Go catch him!" But Mr. Whiskers just kept running and chasing after the butterfly.

I guess he wasn't really thinking about catching anything. Maybe he just wanted to play with Sophie.

But Sophie was very happy to be running around and laughing. She thought that Mr. Whiskers was very silly.

I guess what Sophie was saying was that Mr. Whiskers was just a silly cat. He wasn't really going to catch anything.

