I remember looking up at her with big questions: "Where did all those things come from?"

She just smiled and said that they were her friends. I thought maybe they were stuffed animals, but I didn't say anything. My grandmother just kept on smiling at me.

Years went by and I thought that maybe she just wasn't telling.

