One day Sophie asked her mother, "Where do we live?" Her mother said, "You live in a house on the corner. Isn't that cool?"

But Sophie wasn't so sure. She thought that maybe they lived on another corner. So she asked another question. "Do you think we live on a boat?"

Her mother laughed and said, "You're not on a boat. You're on land." Sophie didn't think that was very believable.

